From 5799f611a6330b4618fa0d27bca9657dfb679216 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nex Audit Apply <z@z.ai>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 07:37:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(design): apply verified 2.6.16 visual & motion audit
 fixes on 2.6.17

Verified-then-applied findings from AUDIT-VISUAL and AUDIT-MOTION (audited
at 06b29cf / 2.6.16) against current 2.6.17 (85fcb42). All 55 contrast
ratios recomputed independently before applying; every touched area
re-tested (ui 369, data 350, client targeted suites + goldens regenerated
and pixel-audited).

Contrast (WCAG 2.2):
- V-01 vault bank-card ink by measured contrast, not the brightness
  estimator (white ink fell to 2.0-2.8:1 on all five shipped faces)
- V-02 notice-capsule action in Light uses accentOnInverse (3.43 -> 8.73)
- V-03 dark/Night snackbar action walked against its own fill (3.80 -> 4.71)
- V-06 module hues and NexHue.amber walked to 3:1 on the light card
- V-07 SoftDark/Night accentFilled #0A73C8 (button boundary 2.93 -> 3.30)
- V-08 NexColors.dangerDark #C6402F for the badge dot on dark grounds
- V-10 tag-filter count at the 12px caption floor, full alpha (2.35 -> 4.93)
- V-15 Light muted #5F6876 - real margin over the elevated container
- V-23 capsule dark hairline white@16% (was @8%, 1.28:1)

Type:
- V-05 Persian body leading at ~1.6 (bodyLarge 15/24, bodyMedium 14/22;
  Latin unchanged; card budget already reserves the room)
- V-18 no fontSize below the 12px floor (attachment badges 9 -> 12,
  group headers 11 -> 12, recurring counts 10 -> 12); PDF badge ink via
  onError so it reads in dark themes too

Consistency:
- V-12 NexSwitch colours derived from colorScheme (no more grey literals)
- V-21 urgent mark: outlined fire glyph at 16px in scheme.error, all
  platforms (was a 14px emoji with a hex Linux fallback)
- V-22 honest comment on the tag auto-palette's light-card visibility

Motion / accessibility:
- F-01 sheets gate on disableAnimationsOf (nexShowSheet, ai_chat_sheet)
- F-02 NexPageRoute appears in place under reduce motion (back-swipe kept)
- F-05 camera route/flash/menu/shutter gated
- F-06 onboarding pages, progress, greeting and module step labels gated
- F-03 haptic tier vocabulary: banner arrival = bump (thud only for
  failed), update offered/ready = bump, checklist tick = tick (finishing
  keeps thud); F-09 all raw haptics routed through the gate, assistant
  double-buzz removed, brand tap = nexTick; F-10 reminder wheel ticks on
  finger-driven landings, bumps on confirm; F-19 NexSwitch ticks
- F-08 indeterminate spinners frozen at 0.5 under reduce motion
  (update/chat/search/AI widgets)
- F-12 banner exit 420 -> 300ms (exit faster than enter, as everywhere)
- F-04 RepaintBoundary around each folding row (pinch fold-all jank)
- F-15 ringing bell one-shot swing re-armed by timer (no frames at rest)
- F-18 filter pill fill fades over 120ms instead of a hard cut
- F-21 words review flip eased (was linear on a perspective transform)

Tests:
- visual_audit_guards_test.dart: vault ink, capsule action, module hues,
  NexHue wash guards
- soft_appearances_test: inverse-capsule action, chip pair, button
  boundary, badge dot, Persian leading guards
- motion_test: reduce-motion sheet/page behaviour tests; gate-aware
  sheet-style lint
- goldens regenerated (all palettes byte-identical; ltr ~0.1%; rtl text
  re-layout from the leading) and pixel-audited

Docs:
- docs/05: Comfort Mode marked retired, palette section reflects the
  shipped 2.6 look, two-family icon rule, NexMotion token scale
- docs/10 ADR-010 amended for the 2.x note-type fan

Not applied (with reasons): V-04 not reproducible (chip labels resolve
onSecondaryContainer = ink, 15.2:1); V-09/V-11/V-13 toggle/V-14/V-16/V-19/
V-20/F-04 chunk 2/F-13/F-14/F-24/F-25/F-26/F-27/F-23 flagged for the
owner - see the delivery notes.
